                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Petitioners contend that the Libertarian Party\u2019s rule to open its primary to independents and members of other parties conflicts with Oklahoma\u2019s semi\u2011closed primary law."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Poe",
          "citations": [
