              "document_hash": "f135baa7f939a913c13ad97a5fcd887944de6ea215b17e80579e44d9ea48a9cf",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-f135baa7f939-0002-0007"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 48,
                "start": 48
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Poe, petitioners argue that the challenges raised by respondents were never raised before this briefing and hearing."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Poe",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "f135baa7f939a913c13ad97a5fcd887944de6ea215b17e80579e44d9ea48a9cf",
              "evidence_ids": [
