              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 49,
                "start": 49
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Poe, petitioners assert that any infringement on a party\u2019s ability to associate is subject to strict scrutiny and requires a compelling state interest, which they say is lacking."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioners",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
